  "raw": " seven months.\n\nBen Johns, a property officer with the county council, said similar heavy default farmers had parked vehicles at derelict sites during their rent arrears “but have never taken them out again”.\n\nHe told members of the public and hydro zoning panel meeting on Thursday: “Extension notices have been issued to Cardiff over the past couple of weeks for failure to pay rent.” He added: “I apologise if I didn’t make myself clear in previous responses that this does relate strongly to the debt owed to the county council. They are paying interest while they unlock the dressing down rights available under bailiffs orders but they also have legal obligations and none of creditors will survive without monies being received to satisfy them. That money is allied with other monies owed because those letters we did install give us a route to ensure we can get here by claiming against the block mates Legacy Motor Holdings Limited [LML] rather than trying something else",
  "serialized": "seven months. Ben Johns, a property officer with the county council, said similar heavy default farmers had parked vehicles at derelict sites during their rent arrears “but have never taken them out again”. He told members of the public and hydro zoning panel meeting on Thursday: “Extension notices have been issued to Cardiff over the past couple of weeks for failure to pay rent.” He added: “I apologise if I didn’t make myself clear in previous responses that this does relate strongly to the debt owed to the county council. They are paying interest while they unlock the dressing down rights available under bailiffs orders but they also have legal obligations and none of creditors will survive without monies being received to satisfy them. That money is allied with other monies owed because those letters we did install give us a route to ensure we can get here by claiming against the block mates Legacy Motor Holdings Limited [LML] rather than trying something else",
